// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  anima_chat.hexa — pure-hexa port of anima_chat.py v2.3
//
//  PURPOSE
//    Full port of the anima chat library SSOT (933 LoC Python) to pure
//    hexa. This is the chat library half of GOAL.md ★★★★★ mission —
//    "[anima_chat 시스템, anima 모델] 조합" 의 system 측 pure-hexa 전환.
//
//    Reference source: /Users/ghost/core/anima/anima_chat.py
//    Reference tag:    anima_chat-v2.3-markdown-filter (commit c2afa8e9e)
//
//  STATUS (2026-05-12)
//    v0.2 — PARSE-COMPLETE + MITOSIS-WIRED + FULL-INFERENCE-LANDED.
//    Helpers behaviorally complete (tokenize wrap, interrogative detect,
//    segment parse, stop detect, markdown filter, force-keyword extract).
//    4-mode generation wires the existing tool/hexa_native/* primitives
//    (engine_ag_nn / gen_modes / byte_tokenizer) + RFC 025/030/031/032/033
//    builtins via fn-style orchestrator (record + functional API).
//
//    v0.2 ADD (TODO[load] RESOLUTION, 2026-05-12):
//      - Section 9 `chat_load_weights` parses safetensors header JSON +
//        binds 218 farr handles (BF16-upcast or F32) into chat["weights"].
//      - Section 9c adds all-farr forward primitives mirroring
//        phase5_forward_smoke.hexa scaled to 24 layers + tied lm_head.
//      - chat_forward_one_token now returns real (vocab=32000) logits
//        when weights are bound. Sentinel preserved for unbound case.
//      - Falsifier suite extended with F-D1-LOAD-1..3 (load-OK, finite
//        logits, greedy round-trip).
//
//    v0.2 (D4b cell-pool wiring, 2026-05-12, LANDED PREVIOUSLY):
//      - AnimaChat record gains `cell_pool` + `mitosis_d_model` +
//        `mitosis_event_log` + `mitosis_step` fields.
//      - chat_init_cell_pool(chat, d_model, n) initializes via
//        mitosis_hook::cell_pool_init.
//      - chat_mitosis_tail(chat, x_in) is a thin wrapper around
//        mitosis_hook::mitosis_forward_tail — called by the generation
//        loop (chat_generate) between final RMSNorm and lm_head.
//
//    See docs/anima_chat_hexa_port_2026_05_12.md (v0.2 update) +
//    docs/anima_chat_mitosis_wiring_2026_05_12.md (D4b audit).
//
//  HEXA EQUIVALENCE MAP (Python -> hexa)
//    safetensors mmap load   -> safetensors_mmap_open / _data_offset /
//                                _read_f32_farr / _read_bf16_to_f32_farr
//                                (RFC 025, RFC 031)
//    safetensors header JSON -> _chat_index_of / _chat_parse_int /
//                                _chat_tensor_offsets / _chat_tensor_dtype
//                                (Section 9, local parser)
//    bytes -> str            -> bytes_to_str_raw (RFC 030)
//    matmul hot loop         -> farr_matmul (RFC 032)
//    deepcopy + gaussian     -> farr_copy + farr_add_gaussian_noise (RFC 033)
//    byte tokenize           -> tool/hexa_native/byte_tokenizer (Phase 4.2)
//    24L GQA forward         -> Section 9c all-farr block (mirrors
//                                phase5_forward_smoke.hexa scaled to 24
//                                layers + tied lm_head)
//    4 gen modes             -> tool/hexa_native/gen_modes (Phase 4.3)
//    mitosis hook            -> tool/hexa_native/mitosis_hook (D4b wired)
//    regex (markdown filter) -> regex_findall / regex_search (stdlib)
//    str fns (split/find)    -> regex_findall + char_at + substring
//    Korean POS (KoNLPy Okt) -> Hangul-range char-class filter (TODO[okt])
//    HF auto-download        -> out of scope (TODO[hf]; caller supplies path)
//    pickle .pt ckpt         -> out of scope (TODO[pickle]; safetensors only)
//
//  TODO MARKERS (scope-out items, follow-up cycles)
//    TODO[okt]    : Korean POS tagger equivalent absent in hexa stdlib.
//                   extract_force_keywords falls back to simpler
//                   "[가-힣]{2,}" chunk extraction + heuristic skip-list.
//                   Behavior diverges from Python on multi-noun prompts —
//                   acceptance per F-AC-HEXA-4 below requires that a
//                   single-noun prompt like "사랑이 뭐야?" yields ["사랑"].
//    TODO[hf]     : HF auto-download (huggingface_hub) deferred to
