//                                  (Hangul "안녕" + ASCII "hello" + emoji
//                                  "🌌") byte-exact match
//    F-AC-HEXA-4 FORCE-KEYWORD  : extract_force_keywords on
//                                  "사용자: 사랑이 뭐야? | 도우미: "
//                                  returns ["사랑이"] (Python no-Okt fallback
//                                  parity — Okt would strip "이" particle,
//                                  but the hexa lane has no Okt; this is
//                                  byte-exact with Python's fallback path)
//    F-AC-HEXA-5 MARKDOWN-FILTER: ban-set produced by _markdown_ban_token_ids
//                                  equals {|, -, :, space} ids = {124+3,
//                                  45+3, 58+3, 32+3} = {127, 48, 61, 35}
//    F-AC-HEXA-6 SMOKE-MAIN     : _smoke() exits without abort (helpers
//                                  only; full inference parity is a
//                                  separate cycle)
//
//  v0.2 FALSIFIERS (D4b cell-pool wiring, see
//                    tool/anima_chat_mitosis_smoke.hexa)
//    F-D4B-1 WIRING-CALL        : chat_generate / chat_mitosis_tail invokes
//                                  mitosis_forward_tail ≥1× per call when
//                                  cell_pool is initialized.
//    F-D4B-2 CELL-POOL-STATE    : AnimaChat record carries cell_pool +
//                                  mitosis_d_model + mitosis_event_log +
//                                  mitosis_step fields after chat_new.
//    F-D4B-3 EVENT-LOG          : chat_generate / chat_mitosis_tail
//                                  accumulates chat["mitosis_event_log"]
//                                  (may be empty within the test horizon —
//                                  empty list is a legitimate signal that
//                                  no split/merge fired yet).
//    F-D4B-4 PRINCIPLE-3        : the wiring does NOT inject any "[role:]"
//                                  / persona marker into the prompt. The
//                                  forward path remains chat_build_prompt
//                                  output unchanged.
//    F-D4B-5 SHAPE-INVAR        : x_combined returned by chat_mitosis_tail
//                                  has the same len() as x_in (==
//                                  mitosis_d_model). Bypass path (cell_pool
//                                  unset) returns x_in unchanged.
//
//  v0.2 FALSIFIERS (TODO[load] resolution — 24-layer weight binding +
//                    full inference, see tool/anima_chat_hexa_smoke.hexa)
//    F-D1-LOAD-1 LOAD-OK        : chat_load_weights binds all 218 farr
//                                  handles (24 layers × 9 + tok_emb +
//                                  norm_f) when the default ckpt exists.
//                                  No -1 farr handles in the weights dict.
//    F-D1-LOAD-2 GEN-SHAPE      : chat_forward_one_token returns a boxed
//                                  list of length 32000 (vocab_size) with
//                                  zero NaN / inf values.
//    F-D1-LOAD-3 ROUND-TRIP     : greedy argmax over those logits yields
//                                  a token id in [3, 258] (valid byte
//                                  range tok_offset..tok_offset+255) and
